{"availability":"available","full":"albertoarena/laravel-truss","name":"laravel-truss","description":"A live database structure viewer for Laravel that renders your schema as a scrollable, zoomable ER diagram. Structure only, never data.","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":285,"forks":12,"created":"2026-07-22T18:51:08Z","updated":"2026-10-09T15:47:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://trussphp.com/","topics":["database","database-schema","developer-tools","entity-relationship-diagram","er-diagram","erd","introspection","laravel","laravel-package","mermaid","php","schema"],"demo":"https://trussphp.com/demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.798Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.798Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.798Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.798Z","stars":285,"forks":12}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Laravel Truss is a live database structure viewer. It scans your live schema and renders it as a scrollable, zoomable ER diagram right inside your app, so you can see how the tables actually connect without opening a DB client. It reads structure only (tables, columns, keys, indexes); row data is never queried or exposed.","Try the live demo to pan, zoom, focus, and export a sample schema in your browser, no install needed, then build a palette in the theme builder and copy the config. See what has shipped and what is next on the roadmap.","Stay updated: click Watch > Custom > Releases to hear about new features, follow along in Discussions, or join the Discord."],"features":["Live ER diagram of your database, rendered with Mermaid.","Focus mode: a table and its foreign-key neighbours, centred and highlighted. The picker is searchable, matching anywhere in the table name, so it stays usable on a schema with hundreds of tables.","Filter by table name, and toggle native types against Laravel-style labels.","Map-style pan and zoom, with auto-fit and a Fit button.","Export the diagram as PNG or SVG, or its structure as JSON, CSV, a Markdown data dictionary, DBML, or a token-trimmed llm format, from the browser or, for CI and tooling, from the command line with php artisan…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/albertoarena/laravel-truss/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"70c193bfd510e54320d306b687f7e8e72055fc1d64f70c6dfb2f5ab86f5ff6cf","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:37.458Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.923Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Laravel Truss is a live database structure viewer. It scans your live schema and renders it as a scrollable, zoomable ER diagram right inside your app, so you can see how the tables actually connect without opening a DB client. It reads structure only (tables, columns, keys, indexes); row data is never queried or exposed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/albertoarena/laravel-truss/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"70c193bfd510e54320d306b687f7e8e72055fc1d64f70c6dfb2f5ab86f5ff6cf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/albertoarena/laravel-truss/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.923Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T15:47:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/albertoarena/laravel-truss/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:34.924Z","hash":"70c193bfd510e54320d306b687f7e8e72055fc1d64f70c6dfb2f5ab86f5ff6cf","originalBytes":28441,"storedBytes":28441,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["truss","php","tables","artisan","schema","export","diagram","structure","dashboard","same","only","own","never","table","format","boost","connection","default","doctor","config","focus","one","database","laravel","panel","what","excluded","file","mcp","output","agent","diff","each","json","server","snapshot","bash","does","get","install","live","payload","row","structure-only","theme","under","when","albertoarena","command","dbml","every","l